WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 4=

01:54.000 --> 01:55.520
We've been on the road
since the first hour of mao.

01:56.080 --> 01:57.360
I haven't had a single bite or sip

01:57.720 --> 01:58.800
this whole way.

02:00.320 --> 02:01.920
It's fine that you didn't
bring some snacks.

02:02.360 --> 02:04.480
But the least you could do
is offer me some water, right?

02:08.240 --> 02:09.520
This journey to Luyeyuan takes us

02:09.800 --> 02:11.080
through remote wilderness
the entire way.

02:11.920 --> 02:12.840
Heavy meals would make it

02:13.280 --> 02:14.040
inconvenient for you.

02:14.480 --> 02:15.840
But it's not inconvenient for you?

02:16.160 --> 02:18.080
I'm a man. I can take care of it easily.

02:18.680 --> 02:19.480
The Crown Prince's banquet

02:19.760 --> 02:20.800
will have fine wine
and delicacies aplenty.

02:21.360 --> 02:23.120
You'll dine well enough there.

02:27.960 --> 02:31.760
(Luyeyuan)

02:31.840 --> 02:32.960
The scenery here is quite lovely.

02:33.440 --> 02:35.080
I came specifically to enjoy the rain.

02:35.840 --> 02:37.040
Lady Jiang, if you're interested,

02:37.640 --> 02:38.560
you're welcome to explore the area.

02:39.520 --> 02:41.360
After such a long journey,

02:41.640 --> 02:42.280
I'm worn out.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.920
May Qingtai and I rest instead?

02:45.880 --> 02:46.480
As you please.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.360
(No matter how clever you are,)

03:01.440 --> 03:03.440
(there's no way you can
escape this deadly trap.)

03:14.960 --> 03:15.720
Admiring the scenery?

03:17.280 --> 03:20.280
Since when does Shen Zaiye
have the leisure for such things?

03:21.440 --> 03:22.960
He brought me here alone this time.

03:23.320 --> 03:25.000
Could this be a trap?

03:25.680 --> 03:26.640
That scheming minister

03:26.960 --> 03:28.840
wouldn't dare try anything
so brazen in broad day light.

03:32.160 --> 03:34.440
(Luyeyuan)

03:41.920 --> 03:42.960
These crab cakes and jujube kernel tea

03:43.040 --> 03:44.600
were specially prepared for you
by Master.

03:46.200 --> 03:47.000
Please enjoy.

04:03.000 --> 04:03.600
It's clean.

04:08.880 --> 04:09.640
This too.

04:17.200 --> 04:19.640
This jujube tea actually
tastes quite nice.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.800
The crab cakes are perfect too,
savory with a touch of sweetness.

04:23.120 --> 04:23.960
Try it, Your Highness.

04:33.880 --> 04:34.480
Don't drink that!

04:35.480 --> 04:36.080
What's wrong?

04:38.160 --> 04:39.400
I just remembered something.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.640
When I was 12,

04:42.200 --> 04:44.720
Empress Lu received a tribute
of sea crabs from merchants

04:45.600 --> 04:46.680
and gifted them all to me.

04:47.200 --> 04:48.400
The crabs were delicious,

04:49.040 --> 04:51.120
but after eating them,
I suffered days of violent diarrhea.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.360
I almost died.

04:53.360 --> 04:53.960
Then…

04:54.040 --> 04:55.720
You mustn't touch these
crab cakes, Your Highness!

04:58.280 --> 04:59.360
Like you, at the time,

04:59.960 --> 05:01.320
I thought that the crab was the problem.

05:02.600 --> 05:04.120
I ran crying to Father, making a scene,

05:04.840 --> 05:05.960
and ended up grounded for a long time.

05:07.600 --> 05:09.040
He said I was making
trouble over nothing.

05:10.000 --> 05:10.600
Later,

05:11.000 --> 05:12.600
a young eunuch from the South

05:12.680 --> 05:13.480
took pity on me

05:13.840 --> 05:14.760
and discreetly told me the truth.

05:15.480 --> 05:16.720
There was nothing
wrong with the crab itself.

05:17.560 --> 05:19.440
But when eaten together
with jujube kernel tea,

05:20.040 --> 05:21.480
it causes violent diarrhea.

05:23.400 --> 05:24.800
From then on, I understood one thing.

05:25.360 --> 05:26.240
If someone wants to harm you,

05:27.080 --> 05:28.240
they don't necessarily
need to use poison.

05:28.920 --> 05:29.520
No wonder!

05:30.120 --> 05:31.320
We set off so early,

05:31.480 --> 05:32.080
and that treacherous chancellor

05:32.160 --> 05:33.240
deliberately starved us on the journey.

05:33.440 --> 05:34.480
This was his trap all along.

05:35.000 --> 05:36.160
He assumed

05:36.720 --> 05:38.560
a northern princess like me,

05:39.360 --> 05:40.320
even if familiar with crabs,

05:41.040 --> 05:43.040
would be too pampered to know

05:43.760 --> 05:45.560
this obscure poisonless poison.

05:46.280 --> 05:47.280
But why

05:47.680 --> 05:50.200
is he trying to give you diarrhea?

05:53.640 --> 05:54.800
So, that means

05:55.280 --> 05:56.560
you've inspected everything

06:00.560 --> 06:01.880
in the study?

06:02.480 --> 06:03.760
By custom,

06:03.960 --> 06:04.840
the Crown Prince's banquet

06:05.120 --> 06:06.480
should be attended by the mistress
of the house as your companion.

06:08.880 --> 06:09.880
You're meticulous and sharp.

06:10.600 --> 06:11.520
I trust you more.

06:12.880 --> 06:13.960
These crab cakes and jujube kernel tea

06:14.040 --> 06:15.680
were specially prepared for you
by Master.

06:22.200 --> 06:24.080
He's trying to get rid of me
using the Crown Prince.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.200
Chancellor,

06:26.560 --> 06:27.760
Wanniang has delivered the food.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.400
Tell Wanniang

06:29.640 --> 06:30.680
she must be patient.

06:31.080 --> 06:32.040
The Crown Prince hasn't arrived yet.

06:32.800 --> 06:33.880
We cannot afford to slip up.

06:39.560 --> 06:41.440
He won't touch me
before the Crown Prince arrives.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.280
He's waiting for the food
to take effect.

06:46.240 --> 06:47.880
When I fall ill and keep
excusing myself during the banquet,

06:48.120 --> 06:49.400
he'll find his chance to kill me

06:49.960 --> 06:50.920
and pin it on the Crown Prince.

06:51.880 --> 06:53.400
But you just married him.

06:53.760 --> 06:54.320
How would he dare?

06:54.400 --> 06:55.360
What wouldn't he dare?

06:55.960 --> 06:57.120
The one to bear the blame
would be the Crown Prince.

06:57.880 --> 07:00.200
When it comes down to it,
a living crown prince

07:00.440 --> 07:01.920
or a dead princess
sent for marriage alliance,

07:03.080 --> 07:04.160
who do you think

07:04.480 --> 07:05.400
Emperor Qi will value more?

07:07.040 --> 07:07.960
As for Shen Zaiye,

07:08.920 --> 07:11.400
if his newly-wedded concubine
were to be killed by the crown prince,

07:12.080 --> 07:14.000
the Emperor might even feel
obligated to compensate him.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.960
Such a brilliant plan,
three birds with one stone.

07:21.280 --> 07:21.880
Your Highness,

07:22.000 --> 07:22.800
let me fight

07:22.880 --> 07:23.680
our way out then.

07:23.840 --> 07:25.080
Let's get out of wretched Qi!

07:25.160 --> 07:25.760
No.

07:28.080 --> 07:29.120
Changjue is waiting for me.

07:29.680 --> 07:30.600
What should we do?

07:31.000 --> 07:32.360
We can't just do nothing
and let him kill you.

07:38.120 --> 07:39.720
Chancellor, Wanniang reported

07:40.360 --> 07:41.480
that the princess is
showing poisoning symptoms.

07:43.840 --> 07:44.960
Based on the dosage,

07:46.000 --> 07:47.400
it wasn't supposed
to take effect so soon.

07:48.240 --> 07:49.560
How come it's starting already?

07:50.960 --> 07:53.360
Perhaps Lady Jiang's constitution
is weak from travel fatigue.

07:54.880 --> 07:55.560
Then we move up the plan.

07:55.760 --> 07:56.680
Tell Wanniang to act now.

07:57.280 --> 07:58.320
When the Crown Prince arrives,

07:58.400 --> 07:59.400
find some way

07:59.480 --> 08:00.400
to dirty his robes.

08:01.200 --> 08:03.120
Then lead him to
Jiang Taohua's quarters to change.

08:04.000 --> 08:04.720
Then,

08:04.960 --> 08:05.960
with Jiang Taohua dead

08:06.040 --> 08:07.000
and the Crown Prince changing clothes
in the same room,

08:07.640 --> 08:09.840
what better setup for
an accidental killing?

08:10.680 --> 08:11.280
Understood.

08:21.480 --> 08:23.280
This bout of diarrhea
came on so suddenly.

08:23.760 --> 08:24.640
Is the privy

08:25.640 --> 08:27.280
still far away?

08:28.360 --> 08:29.440
Worry not, Your Highness.

08:30.280 --> 08:31.120
We're almost there.

08:51.840 --> 08:52.640
Your Highness, watch out!

08:56.440 --> 08:58.720
Your Highness, Shen Zaiye is so vicious.

08:58.920 --> 08:59.920
How are we going to turn this around?

09:01.320 --> 09:02.520
I'll feign poisoning symptoms later

09:02.600 --> 09:03.680
to lower his guard

09:04.320 --> 09:05.080
and lure him into carrying out his plan.

09:06.120 --> 09:07.960
When he goes to greet the Crown Prince,

09:08.520 --> 09:09.800
that will be our chance to escape.

09:10.880 --> 09:12.200
But this plan is incredibly risky.

09:13.360 --> 09:14.520
Our survival

09:14.760 --> 09:15.880
depends on you now, Qingtai.

09:28.920 --> 09:30.040
You should cut off the hand
of that useless servant

09:30.120 --> 09:31.000
who didn't watch where he was going.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.720
That'll teach obedience.

09:33.400 --> 09:35.040
What a shame about my robes.

09:35.800 --> 09:37.640
Your Highness, don't let such
a trivial matter ruin your mood.

09:38.120 --> 09:38.880
Once changed,

09:39.160 --> 09:40.880
I'll drink with you till dawn breaks.

09:42.080 --> 09:43.200
Then you'd better start with
three cups as punishment.

10:00.520 --> 10:02.800
(Serene and elegant)

10:09.120 --> 10:09.840
This way, Your Highness.

10:17.520 --> 10:18.880
(Why has nothing happened?)

10:25.160 --> 10:25.880
(Wanniang?)

10:28.240 --> 10:29.920
(Jiang Taohua!)

10:45.440 --> 10:46.200
Your Highness, watch out!

11:01.600 --> 11:02.200
Chancellor.

11:03.640 --> 11:05.120
Search every corner of
Luyeyuan for Jiang Taohua.

11:05.640 --> 11:06.560
Kill her.

11:07.160 --> 11:07.760
Yes, sir.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.680
But what should we do if Lady Jiang

11:09.760 --> 11:10.360
has escaped Luyeyuan?

11:10.640 --> 11:11.480
She has no one to rely on.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.720
She'll surely try to seek
protection from His Majesty.

11:12.920 --> 11:14.400
We must intercept her
before she reaches the city.

11:14.560 --> 11:15.160
Yes, sir.

11:15.800 --> 11:16.720
What about the Crown Prince?

11:17.200 --> 11:18.040
I'll keep him occupied.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.720
Notify the Chancellor

11:39.400 --> 11:40.520
that we've found the Princess.

11:40.920 --> 11:41.520
Yes, sir.

11:43.800 --> 11:45.160
Where are we going, Your Highness?

11:45.720 --> 11:46.640
To Yujing City.

11:48.400 --> 11:49.560
When that treacherous chancellor
realizes he has failed,

11:49.760 --> 11:51.400
he'll search everywhere for us.

11:51.800 --> 11:53.800
Should we hide in
the mountains for a while

11:53.960 --> 11:54.640
and wait it out?

11:55.640 --> 11:56.880
Since he has decided to kill me,

11:57.280 --> 11:58.160
he won't stop until he succeeds.

11:59.560 --> 12:01.880
There's only one person
who can save our lives.

12:09.800 --> 12:10.560
(Qingtai,)

12:10.840 --> 12:12.400
(you must hold off the pursuers for me.)

12:12.760 --> 12:14.080
(Before I can find the one
person who can save us,)

12:14.440 --> 12:15.480
(I'll need leverage.)

12:16.240 --> 12:17.200
(Leverage?)

12:17.400 --> 12:18.000
(Yes.)

12:18.240 --> 12:19.480
(Something that will
convince that person.)

12:22.440 --> 12:23.160
(Rest assured, Your Highness,)

12:24.080 --> 12:25.720
(I'll buy you the time you need,)

12:26.560 --> 12:28.040
(even if it costs me my life.)

12:37.400 --> 12:38.960
Once we sell off this half a pig leg

12:39.120 --> 12:40.200
and this jar of pig's blood today,

12:40.520 --> 12:42.640
we'll treat ourselves
to a proper feast in town!

12:42.720 --> 12:43.320
Sounds nice!

12:44.360 --> 12:44.960
(Pig's blood?)

13:13.080 --> 13:13.680
Oh, no.

13:14.120 --> 13:14.720
We've been tricked!

13:19.480 --> 13:20.160
Who is it?

13:21.280 --> 13:22.400
Coming!

13:26.720 --> 13:28.240
I am Princess Chengping of Beiyuan,

13:28.720 --> 13:29.680
Jiang Taohua.

13:30.480 --> 13:32.320
I request an audience with Prince Wuxia.

13:33.400 --> 13:34.000
You…

13:42.200 --> 13:43.440
(Luyeyuan)

13:43.520 --> 13:45.400
They say the Princess of Beiyuan
is a peerless beauty.

13:46.160 --> 13:47.600
Since you brought her
here for the banquet,

13:48.040 --> 13:49.240
why are you hiding her away?

13:50.080 --> 13:50.720
Unfortunately,

13:51.360 --> 13:53.080
Lady Jiang fell ill as
soon as she arrived.

13:53.680 --> 13:55.080
I was worried she might
pass her illness to you,

13:55.640 --> 13:56.680
so I had her rest away from the hall.

13:58.000 --> 13:58.600
Never mind then.

13:59.400 --> 14:00.680
I came to see you today

14:01.040 --> 14:02.360
for other matters anyway.

14:10.400 --> 14:12.200
Your Highness, an emergency
demands my attention.

14:12.400 --> 14:14.240
I'm afraid today's banquet
will have to end here.

14:14.880 --> 14:15.480
Hold on.

14:16.760 --> 14:19.200
It took me two hours to get here.

14:19.560 --> 14:21.120
The audacity of you

14:21.520 --> 14:22.840
to just leave me here like this

14:23.080 --> 14:23.880
before the food

14:25.280 --> 14:25.920
is even served.

14:27.680 --> 14:28.400
The matter is urgent.

14:28.880 --> 14:29.760
I only hope for
your understanding, Your Highness.

14:30.800 --> 14:32.520
What if I refuse to be understanding?

14:34.040 --> 14:34.800
Then do as you please.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.240
That wretched lowlife.

14:49.960 --> 14:51.040
He's not even worthy to
be a footstool beneath me.

14:51.120 --> 14:51.960
The nerve of him to treat me like that!

14:52.040 --> 14:52.680
Please spare me, Your Highness!

14:53.000 --> 14:53.680
Your Highness,

14:53.800 --> 14:54.680
such rage will only harm your health.

14:54.840 --> 14:57.000
Save your strength for dealing
with Chancellor Shen instead.

14:57.280 --> 14:58.440
Teach him a lesson.

15:05.280 --> 15:05.880
Your Highness…

15:21.560 --> 15:22.640
You're right.

15:23.760 --> 15:25.880
Shen Zaiye is utterly insolent.

15:26.840 --> 15:29.040
There's no need to keep testing him.

15:30.160 --> 15:31.480
He wants to investigate dirty money?

15:33.080 --> 15:34.120
Let him.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.200
When he hits a dead end,

15:38.760 --> 15:40.680
he'll end up tangled in his own web.

15:41.200 --> 15:41.800
Yes, Your Highness.

15:44.960 --> 15:46.520
Chancellor, I made a mistake.

15:46.800 --> 15:48.800
I mistook the disguised Qingtai
for Lady Jiang

15:49.240 --> 15:50.240
and failed to stop her.

15:50.680 --> 15:51.440
Please punish me.

15:54.440 --> 15:55.760
I underestimated her after all.

15:57.320 --> 15:58.320
She went into the city…

15:59.040 --> 16:00.360
But not to see His Majesty.

16:01.400 --> 16:02.400
Who else in Yujing City

16:03.280 --> 16:04.240
could she possibly turn to for help?

16:05.520 --> 16:06.600
Chancellor!

16:09.400 --> 16:10.280
I've been looking all over for you.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.320
Prince Wuxia has summoned you
to his residence.

16:15.680 --> 16:18.160
(So she's turned to
Prince Wuxia for help.

16:18.520 --> 16:21.360
(Langhua Residence)

16:26.600 --> 16:27.400
How is she?

16:28.120 --> 16:29.240
My skills are limited.

16:29.800 --> 16:31.720
For now, I've only managed
to stop the bleeding.

16:32.240 --> 16:33.360
To fully treat her,

16:33.960 --> 16:35.840
I need to prepare
anesthesia powder first.

16:36.360 --> 16:37.760
I'll stitch the wound
once it takes effect.

16:41.680 --> 16:43.720
How can you smile

16:44.800 --> 16:45.960
while so badly injured?

16:47.440 --> 16:48.600
I just thought of something.

16:50.000 --> 16:51.000
When I was little,

16:52.120 --> 16:53.280
every time I got hurt,

16:55.000 --> 16:56.040
my younger brother

16:57.000 --> 16:58.760
would be the one to panic and worry.

17:00.320 --> 17:02.680
Here in Qi, I have no family.

17:03.880 --> 17:05.599
Seeing your concern just now,

17:06.560 --> 17:08.200
it felt so familiar.

17:10.880 --> 17:11.560
Careful.

17:12.200 --> 17:12.800
Yes, Your Highness.

17:15.720 --> 17:17.400
I may have three brothers in name,

17:18.119 --> 17:19.640
but I grew up in a remote palace

17:20.440 --> 17:22.200
and rarely experienced
the warmth of kinship.

17:23.520 --> 17:24.400
Affection runs cold in a royal family.

17:26.040 --> 17:28.040
For you to have
such a bond with your brother,

17:28.640 --> 17:29.560
it's rare and precious.

17:30.560 --> 17:31.760
Siblings

17:32.600 --> 17:33.480
are fate's gift,

17:34.240 --> 17:35.200
but also choice.

17:36.480 --> 17:37.720
Back at Zuimeng Pavilion,

17:39.400 --> 17:40.920
when I was abandoned by everyone,

17:42.440 --> 17:43.320
it was you

17:44.200 --> 17:45.400
who spoke for me.

17:46.520 --> 17:48.120
And now, caught in yet another storm,

17:48.520 --> 17:50.160
you saved me once again.

17:50.760 --> 17:51.880
For all that you've done,

17:53.920 --> 17:55.400
please accept my deepest gratitude.

17:56.320 --> 17:57.320
There's no need for this.

17:59.480 --> 18:01.160
I only did what
my heart told me was right.

18:02.520 --> 18:03.160
But

18:03.920 --> 18:05.680
how did you end up so badly injured?

18:06.720 --> 18:07.800
Chancellor and the Crown Prince

18:08.240 --> 18:10.800
arranged to meet at Luyeyuan today.

18:11.880 --> 18:13.360
Chancellor brought me along.

18:14.560 --> 18:16.320
But we were ambushed by assassins.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.760
I lost sight of Chancellor in the chaos.

18:20.480 --> 18:21.600
I see.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.360
You've been on your
own in a foreign land.

18:26.760 --> 18:27.600
It can't have been easy.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.520
If you'd accept help from
an unimportant prince like me,

18:30.160 --> 18:31.240
you can come to me

18:31.560 --> 18:32.280
if you ever need help again.

18:33.280 --> 18:34.080
Thank you, Your Highness.

18:39.080 --> 18:39.680
Physician.

18:40.800 --> 18:41.400
Physician.

18:42.360 --> 18:43.160
Is the medicine ready?

18:44.040 --> 18:45.000
Your Highness, there's no need.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.840
This wound isn't
something fit to be seen.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.320
I'd rather return

18:52.000 --> 18:53.120
and tend to it myself.

18:53.880 --> 18:54.920
Is it really unfit to be seen

18:55.400 --> 18:56.720
or are you afraid to show a wound

18:58.120 --> 18:59.040
that doesn't exist?

19:01.120 --> 19:01.920
Chancellor…

19:04.600 --> 19:07.280
Have you gotten so used
to raiding people's homes

19:08.360 --> 19:09.840
that you now barge
into others' residences

19:09.920 --> 19:11.240
like they're your own?

19:12.080 --> 19:13.800
I heard Lady Jiang was here,

19:14.640 --> 19:15.800
and I came urgently to find her.

19:16.560 --> 19:17.640
Forgive me

19:18.320 --> 19:19.520
if I have offended you, Your Highness.

19:20.760 --> 19:21.360
Lady Jiang,

19:22.320 --> 19:23.040
if you're done with this charade,

19:23.920 --> 19:24.880
we're leaving.

19:35.960 --> 19:37.840
I'll return with you now.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.240
Your Highness.

19:41.720 --> 19:42.800
She's gravely injured!

19:44.080 --> 19:45.520
It's one thing that you
won't show concern,

19:46.000 --> 19:47.640
can't you at least
let her recover in peace?

19:48.960 --> 19:50.280
Your Highness, please calm down.

19:52.200 --> 19:52.880
Jiang Taohua,

19:53.560 --> 19:54.640
you may fool others,

19:55.400 --> 19:56.920
but not me.
I was born in the countryside.

19:58.320 --> 19:59.640
That blood reeks.

20:00.600 --> 20:01.920
It's clearly not human blood.

20:09.520 --> 20:10.840
I'm not even human

20:11.880 --> 20:13.400
in your eyes now.

20:14.800 --> 20:16.040
What more is there to say?

20:17.400 --> 20:18.040
Shen Zaiye,

20:19.000 --> 20:19.920
as a minister,

20:20.360 --> 20:21.480
you throw your weight around in court,

20:21.560 --> 20:22.560
daring fate and inviting disaster.

20:23.040 --> 20:23.760
As a husband,

20:24.240 --> 20:26.120
you shirk your responsibilities
and treat her with complete neglect.

20:26.280 --> 20:27.920
What right do you have
to treat her like this?

20:28.000 --> 20:28.600
You…

20:45.360 --> 20:46.600
I thought

20:47.760 --> 20:49.480
those assassins at Luyeyuan

20:50.600 --> 20:52.080
came for you, Chancellor.

20:53.520 --> 20:55.400
That I was merely collateral damage.

20:56.560 --> 20:57.640
But now I see

20:58.840 --> 21:00.760
you ordered my death yourself.

21:01.960 --> 21:02.680
Well then,

21:03.400 --> 21:04.360
take it.

21:06.240 --> 21:07.040
Shen Zaiye,

21:07.760 --> 21:08.960
others may fear you,

21:09.520 --> 21:10.600
but I don't.

21:11.480 --> 21:12.720
The attempt on the princess's life,

21:13.760 --> 21:14.640
I will see justice done.

21:23.040 --> 21:25.040
(I knew ordinary tricks
wouldn't fool you,)

21:25.640 --> 21:27.040
(so I had to wager real flesh)

21:27.800 --> 21:29.200
(to fight for a chance to live.)

21:46.160 --> 21:47.960
(Now that I have
Prince Wuxia's protection,)

21:48.480 --> 21:49.920
(let's see how you can)

21:50.400 --> 21:51.920
(kill me now, Chancellor Shen.)

21:55.920 --> 21:56.720
Chancellor Shen,

21:58.040 --> 21:59.240
the princess is your concubine.

21:59.960 --> 22:01.240
By rights, I shouldn't meddle in it.

22:01.680 --> 22:02.720
But given what happened today,

22:02.800 --> 22:04.080
I can no longer stand aside.

22:05.000 --> 22:05.640
Tell me,

22:06.600 --> 22:07.680
was the attack on the princess

22:07.760 --> 22:09.160
in any way connected to you?

22:09.800 --> 22:11.320
I suggest you think carefully
before answering.

22:12.000 --> 22:13.400
Don't try to deceive me

22:13.480 --> 22:14.240
with courtly tricks.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.000
Yes.

22:22.120 --> 22:23.600
I regret ever supporting

22:23.680 --> 22:24.560
her request

22:24.640 --> 22:25.600
to marry you in court.

22:26.600 --> 22:27.920
A princess was willing to marry you

22:28.360 --> 22:29.240
as a concubine.

22:29.800 --> 22:31.560
I thought you'd at least
treat her better.

22:32.120 --> 22:34.000
I never imagined you'd take
the tactics you use

22:34.160 --> 22:35.480
against your political rivals

22:35.560 --> 22:36.800
and turn them on a woman.

22:36.920 --> 22:37.520
You are…

22:38.200 --> 22:39.320
You're utterly despicable.

22:44.160 --> 22:44.840
Your Highness,

22:46.240 --> 22:47.400
not everything in this world

22:47.920 --> 22:49.440
is simply black or white.

22:50.760 --> 22:52.120
Sometimes, doing the wrong thing

22:52.640 --> 22:54.080
is the only way to
reach the right outcome.

22:55.000 --> 22:56.160
I admire

22:56.360 --> 22:57.400
your righteousness.

22:58.360 --> 23:00.760
But even if you want to act
out of justice and compassion,

23:01.600 --> 23:02.720
surely you can't keep Jiang Taohua

23:02.800 --> 23:04.320
hidden away in your residence forever?

23:06.800 --> 23:08.400
If you intend to take her back,

23:09.160 --> 23:10.800
you must give me your word right now,

23:11.640 --> 23:12.920
that you'll protect her from now on.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.040
Remember this,

23:15.160 --> 23:16.600
if anything happens to her,

23:16.680 --> 23:18.120
I'll hold you responsible.

23:18.720 --> 23:19.520
And if it comes to it,

23:21.240 --> 23:22.760
I'm still Father's son.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.880
Even if I have to risk my life,

23:25.120 --> 23:26.600
I will make sure you pay for it.

23:31.880 --> 23:32.640
What are you smiling at?

23:34.560 --> 23:35.200
Nothing.

23:36.440 --> 23:37.280
You have my word.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.520
Forgive me, Your Highness.

23:40.920 --> 23:43.000
Lady Jiang absolutely
refuses to take the anesthesia.

23:43.480 --> 23:44.840
She insists on staying
conscious for the stitching.

23:45.160 --> 23:46.360
I can't bring myself to do it.

23:46.960 --> 23:47.920
You can only treat her fully

23:48.920 --> 23:49.800
after the suture?

23:50.080 --> 23:50.680
Yes.

23:52.760 --> 23:53.360
I'll do it then.

23:54.400 --> 23:55.840
You're not going to
hurt her again, are you?

23:58.520 --> 24:00.160
Your Highness, didn't you
just say it yourself?

24:01.120 --> 24:03.000
If anything happens to Jiang Taohua,

24:03.400 --> 24:04.520
you'll hold me accountable.

24:05.200 --> 24:05.800
Right now,

24:06.240 --> 24:08.320
I'm the last person who wants her dead.

24:09.720 --> 24:10.360
Besides,

24:10.840 --> 24:12.760
the imperial physicians
won't arrive in time.

24:13.240 --> 24:13.880
Unless you'd prefer

24:14.760 --> 24:15.640
to stitch her yourself, Your Highness?

24:19.680 --> 24:20.760
I'll allow you to treat her.

24:36.040 --> 24:37.240
I'll ask you one last time.

24:37.880 --> 24:39.240
Are you sure you don't
want the anesthesia?

24:40.680 --> 24:41.280
Yes.

24:44.560 --> 24:45.840
Since you've chosen to endure the pain,

24:47.320 --> 24:48.160
endure it to the end then.

25:07.840 --> 25:08.480
Tell me,

25:09.240 --> 25:10.240
how did you figure it out?

25:13.240 --> 25:14.440
The pairing of crab
and jujube kernel tea.

25:15.640 --> 25:16.280
I've had it before.

25:18.360 --> 25:19.440
Then you're quite lucky.

25:20.920 --> 25:22.240
If I were truly lucky,

25:22.800 --> 25:24.240
I wouldn't be lying here like this.

25:33.880 --> 25:34.880
There are countless
powerful figures in Qi.

25:35.560 --> 25:38.240
Why did you choose
to turn to Prince Wuxia?

25:39.560 --> 25:40.920
It was a gamble.

25:42.040 --> 25:42.920
If I had

25:43.560 --> 25:44.880
headed straight for the palace today,

25:45.760 --> 25:47.320
I wouldn't have made it past your men.

25:48.720 --> 25:50.400
So I chose the unexpected path instead.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.800
And the truth shows

25:54.360 --> 25:55.680
I won the bet.

26:05.280 --> 26:06.120
Take a break.

26:13.240 --> 26:13.840
No need.

26:15.000 --> 26:16.120
Stopping and starting again

26:17.120 --> 26:18.640
makes it easier to lose consciousness.

26:19.720 --> 26:20.840
And what if you do?

26:24.600 --> 26:25.400
Chancellor,

26:27.040 --> 26:28.400
you already know the answer.

26:30.240 --> 26:31.560
Losing consciousness is easy,

26:32.600 --> 26:34.000
but I might not wake up again.

26:36.000 --> 26:37.200
So you refused to take anesthesia

26:38.120 --> 26:40.280
because you were worried
I might poison you again.

26:41.200 --> 26:42.400
A princess of Beiyuan

26:42.880 --> 26:44.960
is living like a bandit queen.

26:46.080 --> 26:47.080
You've had it hard, haven't you?

26:47.440 --> 26:48.520
If I hadn't,

26:49.320 --> 26:50.400
how else

26:51.280 --> 26:53.000
could I possibly survive in a world

26:53.760 --> 26:54.880
filled with wolves and tigers?

26:57.840 --> 26:58.600
Shen Zaiye,

26:59.120 --> 27:00.240
do you really know how to suture?

27:01.480 --> 27:02.080
I do.

27:02.760 --> 27:04.680
It's just that your furious face

27:05.000 --> 27:07.280
is far more pleasing than your

27:08.120 --> 27:08.960
pretentious act.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.040
You…

27:12.000 --> 27:18.440
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

27:18.840 --> 27:23.000
♪Though shackles bind
my soul and chain my form♪

27:23.120 --> 27:25.880
♪I've walked through
life and death before♪

27:26.280 --> 27:32.000
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

27:33.080 --> 27:37.000
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

27:37.480 --> 27:40.200
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

27:40.320 --> 27:42.800
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

27:42.880 --> 27:48.120
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

28:04.680 --> 28:06.360
You should've waited
for the imperial physicians.

28:07.080 --> 28:08.200
It's better to let me stitch it.

28:08.520 --> 28:09.560
It'll heal faster this way.

28:11.400 --> 28:12.040
After all,

28:13.640 --> 28:14.680
stitching up the dead is easy.

28:15.840 --> 28:16.880
It's the living that make it difficult.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.320
Physician.

28:20.320 --> 28:21.200
Come in and dress the wound.

28:23.120 --> 28:23.720
Yes, sir.

28:28.520 --> 28:29.800
Your stitching

28:30.360 --> 28:31.520
will leave her a scar.

28:31.760 --> 28:33.000
It won't be pretty when it heals.

28:34.040 --> 28:35.600
That spot was only
ever meant for my eyes.

28:36.600 --> 28:37.560
It won't scare anyone else.

28:38.320 --> 28:39.920
You don't need to be so on edge.

28:41.080 --> 28:42.120
I've given my word to Prince Wuxia

28:42.840 --> 28:43.720
that I'd keep you alive.

28:46.120 --> 28:46.920
Get some rest.

29:02.000 --> 29:03.760
(For the first time,
I feel I've met my match.)

29:05.000 --> 29:06.680
(Who knew it'd be the
Princess of Beiyuan.)

29:12.520 --> 29:17.680
(Shen Residence)

29:20.560 --> 29:21.280
Chancellor,

29:21.560 --> 29:23.000
Lady Jiang has been
unconscious for quite some time.

29:23.680 --> 29:25.680
Shall I call for another physician?

29:26.120 --> 29:26.720
No need.

29:27.000 --> 29:27.760
She's out of danger now.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.680
With some proper rest, she'll recover.

29:30.520 --> 29:31.120
Also,

29:31.640 --> 29:32.880
while Lady Jiang is recuperating,

29:33.120 --> 29:33.920
all household provisions

29:34.160 --> 29:35.600
are to prioritize Zhengchun Boudoir.

29:36.240 --> 29:38.480
Anyone in the residence who shows
the slightest neglect shall be punished.

29:38.800 --> 29:39.600
Understood.

29:42.360 --> 29:43.320
Don't leave me.

30:04.480 --> 30:05.520
Mother,

30:06.160 --> 30:07.120
don't leave me.

30:11.840 --> 30:12.440
Mother,

30:12.520 --> 30:13.320
it's strong!

30:14.080 --> 30:15.840
This is Ling wine from our Hao City.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.200
It's made from lake water,

30:19.200 --> 30:20.520
with drifting duckweed
and floating moss.

30:20.800 --> 30:21.800
It's fierce and aromatic.

30:22.520 --> 30:23.840
You'll understand when you're older.

30:24.320 --> 30:26.760
It tastes far better than
those bland tribute wines

30:26.840 --> 30:27.800
we get in the palace.

30:29.080 --> 30:29.680
Mother,

30:29.760 --> 30:30.560
it's so beautiful!

30:31.520 --> 30:32.120
You want it?

30:32.200 --> 30:32.800
Yes.

30:33.840 --> 30:37.000
But Father says girls
shouldn't touch such things.

30:38.600 --> 30:39.360
How much for this?

30:39.800 --> 30:40.400
That one?

30:41.080 --> 30:41.680
It's not for sale.

30:41.840 --> 30:43.440
It's a prize.

30:44.240 --> 30:45.240
See that bell over there?

30:45.560 --> 30:46.960
As long as you can it,

30:47.440 --> 30:48.480
that becomes yours.

30:48.880 --> 30:50.680
Mother, it's so far.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.200
I can't even see it clearly.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.600
Can we really hit it?

30:54.680 --> 30:55.280
Shopkeeper,

30:55.360 --> 30:55.960
let me have a try.

31:06.360 --> 31:07.880
That was amazing, Mother!

31:08.520 --> 31:10.560
Men are like eagles
soaring through the skies,

31:10.920 --> 31:13.040
but women are
the wild horses of the plains.

31:13.400 --> 31:14.520
Neither is lesser than the other.

31:15.040 --> 31:16.040
Remember this, Taohua,

31:16.560 --> 31:17.760
whatever you want to do,

31:18.080 --> 31:19.400
you can do it.

31:20.640 --> 31:22.280
To me,

31:22.360 --> 31:24.720
you are the bravest,
most wonderful girl.

31:25.840 --> 31:26.840
Mother…

31:36.520 --> 31:37.160
Yuetao,

31:37.680 --> 31:39.440
all these years you've
accompanied me in this household,

31:40.360 --> 31:42.080
have you ever seen that look
on Chancellor's face?

31:43.280 --> 31:44.280
Don't overthink it, Madam.

31:44.960 --> 31:47.440
We used Lady Jiang to spy on his study.

31:47.840 --> 31:48.680
And days later,

31:48.960 --> 31:50.120
she's nearly assassinated.

31:50.480 --> 31:51.280
The timing is suspicious.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.360
I know.

31:54.560 --> 31:55.800
Chancellor must be involved

31:56.200 --> 31:57.720
in Lady Jiang's assassination.

31:59.040 --> 32:00.120
But from what I saw just now,

32:01.000 --> 32:03.280
his feelings for her didn't seem fake.

32:07.040 --> 32:08.040
My husband

32:08.880 --> 32:10.640
was born to be a statesman.

32:12.480 --> 32:13.640
Affection means nothing to him.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.600
Whoever stands in his way

32:16.520 --> 32:17.720
must die.

32:19.120 --> 32:21.200
We'd better send the stuff out

32:22.240 --> 32:23.520
before Chancellor finds out.

32:32.920 --> 32:35.640
(Zhengchun Boudoir)

32:35.720 --> 32:37.680
That treacherous chancellor
is acting all different toward you.

32:38.600 --> 32:39.760
Is he cooking up

32:39.840 --> 32:41.440
a new plan?

32:42.920 --> 32:45.000
We can't keep playing defense forever.

32:49.600 --> 32:50.680
I have to find a way

32:51.320 --> 32:52.720
to keep him in check

32:53.440 --> 32:54.960
and take control of my situation.

32:56.520 --> 32:58.440
But your poison
is about to act up again.

32:58.560 --> 33:00.120
Your priority should be
getting the antidote.

33:00.560 --> 33:02.160
Should we hurry
and send the painting out?

33:15.360 --> 33:16.520
(I'm drawing them out)

33:17.160 --> 33:18.560
(from memory.)

34:07.280 --> 34:08.600
Give this to Yang Wanqing.

34:09.320 --> 34:10.120
Tell him it contains

34:10.480 --> 34:12.080
the Sunlight over
a Thousand Peaks scroll

34:12.159 --> 34:13.159
Empress Lu is looking for.

34:14.360 --> 34:16.719
But the lockdown
on the estate hasn't been lifted.

34:17.199 --> 34:19.880
No one is allowed to leave.

34:22.719 --> 34:24.239
But they never said people
couldn't come in, did they?

34:24.920 --> 34:26.280
True,

34:26.760 --> 34:28.920
but no visitors have come either.

34:30.560 --> 34:32.560
Unforbidden means permitted.

34:33.679 --> 34:34.400
Anyway,

34:35.199 --> 34:36.880
if you want to open a window,

34:37.560 --> 34:39.000
you have to make them believe

34:39.400 --> 34:40.639
you'll blow the whole roof off.

34:46.480 --> 34:48.440
(Shen Residence)

34:48.920 --> 34:49.600
Let me out!

34:50.000 --> 34:50.920
Let me out!

34:51.000 --> 34:51.679
Why can't I go out?

34:51.760 --> 34:52.440
Whose order is it?

34:52.520 --> 34:53.320
Miss Qingtai.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.040
Miss Qingtai,

34:54.280 --> 34:55.159
please understand.

34:55.679 --> 34:56.679
Chancellor gave strict orders

34:56.760 --> 34:58.800
that no one is to leave the estate.

34:59.120 --> 35:00.760
My lady just regained
consciousness after a serious injury.

35:01.240 --> 35:02.080
She's homesick,

35:02.160 --> 35:03.760
and all she wants is
a taste of Beiyuan pastries.

35:04.040 --> 35:05.200
And now you're telling me

35:05.280 --> 35:06.080
you can't even grant her that?

35:06.920 --> 35:08.120
Didn't Chancellor say

35:08.200 --> 35:09.480
we were to be well cared for?

35:10.040 --> 35:11.800
And look at you,
you're rejecting our request.

35:12.120 --> 35:13.920
Aren't you afraid he'll punish you
when he finds out?

35:14.240 --> 35:14.920
Let me out!

35:15.240 --> 35:15.920
Let me out!

35:16.000 --> 35:16.600
Taohua.

35:18.920 --> 35:19.520
Taohua,

35:20.280 --> 35:21.000
I don't have the authority

35:21.080 --> 35:22.080
to let anyone leave the estate.

35:22.360 --> 35:23.080
Whatever you are craving for,

35:23.160 --> 35:24.200
just tell the kitchen to make it.

35:24.520 --> 35:25.840
You really think Qi's cook is capable

35:26.160 --> 35:27.880
of making our Beiyuan pastries?

35:29.080 --> 35:30.480
To think she's a princess,

35:30.960 --> 35:32.600
throwing tantrums over snacks

35:33.040 --> 35:35.040
right after Chancellor gave the order.

35:35.880 --> 35:37.200
No sense of the bigger picture at all.

35:37.520 --> 35:38.280
What a disgrace.

35:39.280 --> 35:41.040
Having just escaped death,

35:42.160 --> 35:44.440
I still feel shaken.

35:45.400 --> 35:46.960
I can't help but miss home.

35:48.600 --> 35:49.800
Please forgive my weakness.

35:51.120 --> 35:52.360
So much for prioritizing
Zhengchun Boudoir

35:52.960 --> 35:55.200
when they deny even basic comforts!

35:55.440 --> 35:56.400
Qingtai.

35:57.200 --> 35:58.920
The fault lies not with Madam,

36:00.360 --> 36:02.040
but with those meddlesome,

36:02.480 --> 36:03.480
troublemaking servants.

36:04.760 --> 36:05.360
Lady Jiang,

36:05.440 --> 36:06.280
what's that supposed to mean?

36:06.880 --> 36:08.320
I'm just following orders.

36:08.560 --> 36:09.400
Whose orders exactly?

36:09.920 --> 36:11.200
Chancellor clearly said

36:11.520 --> 36:12.120
anyone who slights Her Highness

36:12.200 --> 36:13.040
shall be punished.

36:14.000 --> 36:14.880
Jiang Taohua,

36:15.560 --> 36:17.560
just because you're slightly injured

36:17.760 --> 36:18.360
doesn't mean you can…

36:20.160 --> 36:20.760
Your Highness!

36:24.440 --> 36:26.000
Lady Qin, how could you attack her?

36:26.240 --> 36:26.920
What is this?

36:27.560 --> 36:29.120
Your princess clearly fell by herself.

36:29.200 --> 36:30.320
- Nonsense!
- Everyone saw it.

36:30.400 --> 36:32.160
I saw it with my own eyes
that Lady Qin pushed her!

36:32.360 --> 36:33.000
- Stop making lies now.
- I'm going to kill you!

36:33.080 --> 36:33.680
Enough!

36:35.160 --> 36:36.320
We mustn't ruin the harmony here.

36:36.800 --> 36:38.000
Tell Chancellor about this.

36:38.360 --> 36:39.520
Let him decide what's to be done.

36:46.800 --> 36:48.800
Since Lady Jiang is feeling homesick,

36:49.280 --> 36:50.040
let her have her way.

36:51.400 --> 36:52.520
But leaving the estate
is out of the question.

36:52.920 --> 36:53.720
Whatever she's craving for,

36:54.760 --> 36:55.600
have someone bring it in.

36:59.960 --> 37:01.160
The same goes for the other ladies.

37:01.800 --> 37:02.400
If they lack anything,

37:03.000 --> 37:04.720
have Madam arrange it all together.

37:05.240 --> 37:05.840
Yes, sir.

37:07.600 --> 37:08.240
Chancellor,

37:08.880 --> 37:10.680
ever since Lady Jiang was attacked,

37:10.800 --> 37:12.080
her personality really has changed.

37:13.920 --> 37:14.600
Changed?

37:15.720 --> 37:17.600
She's just stopped hiding her tail.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.480
The fox has shown its true face.

37:22.560 --> 37:24.160
(You're not the one I was looking for,)

37:24.600 --> 37:25.920
(but you've been
trying to stir up trouble.)

37:26.200 --> 37:28.720
(Very well, you'll be my bait then.)

37:33.040 --> 37:34.320
Stop. What's your business here?

37:34.840 --> 37:35.880
I'm delivering food.

37:37.560 --> 37:38.880
Madam, is there anything you need?

37:39.200 --> 37:40.520
Chancellor said no one
is to be overlooked.

37:41.200 --> 37:41.800
Madam would like…

37:41.880 --> 37:42.480
Yuetao.

37:44.040 --> 37:44.920
Thank Chancellor for me.

37:45.400 --> 37:47.080
I have everything I need.

37:49.080 --> 37:50.680
Pass him the food.
You're not allowed to enter.

37:51.880 --> 37:52.480
Yes, sir.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.800
Madam, why did you…

38:07.880 --> 38:08.840
This is a setup by Chancellor.

38:10.000 --> 38:11.360
He's begun to suspect me.

38:12.400 --> 38:14.240
And now, he's even
laid a trap to draw me out.

38:14.960 --> 38:16.040
That just proves
how critical this item is.

38:16.200 --> 38:17.000
We can't lose it.

38:17.800 --> 38:19.080
But given the situation,

38:19.360 --> 38:20.400
it's unlikely we'll
get out of the estate.

38:21.240 --> 38:22.400
We'll have to find another way.

38:23.120 --> 38:24.960
Since Chancellor is suspecting us,

38:25.680 --> 38:26.840
maybe we should just give up this time.

38:30.960 --> 38:31.560
No.

38:32.400 --> 38:34.120
My family's fate is tied
to the Crown Prince's.

38:35.120 --> 38:36.120
I can't take that risk.

38:36.640 --> 38:37.440
But…

38:38.320 --> 38:40.640
Shouldn't you think
about your future too?

38:41.480 --> 38:43.760
I know how you feel about Chancellor.

38:44.320 --> 38:45.960
But if this plan really succeeds,

38:47.280 --> 38:49.720
there won't be any chance
left between you and him.

38:51.880 --> 38:52.640
My future…

38:54.400 --> 38:55.600
As the eldest daughter of Meng family,

38:56.800 --> 38:59.360
I exist only for the clan's legacy.

39:00.360 --> 39:01.920
There has never been a future for me.

39:04.840 --> 39:05.640
I must find a way

39:06.960 --> 39:08.440
to get this item out.

39:10.560 --> 39:11.440
What is this?

39:11.960 --> 39:13.360
(Zhengchun Boudoir)
(Sunlight over a Thousand Peaks)

39:14.520 --> 39:15.720
If what Her Majesty said is true,

39:16.120 --> 39:18.280
and Chancellor Shen is secretly keeping
the Sunlight over a Thousand Peaks

39:18.960 --> 39:20.120
painted by Xue Ran,

39:20.640 --> 39:21.640
then this is the same painting.

39:50.160 --> 39:53.160
However, the brushwork in
the painting varies too much.

39:53.520 --> 39:54.600
They clearly weren't
done by the same person.

39:55.680 --> 39:57.960
Most likely, that treacherous
chancellor had someone forge it

39:58.320 --> 39:59.480
and placed it in his study on purpose

39:59.560 --> 40:00.680
to bait someone out.

40:01.440 --> 40:02.200
What does that mean?

40:03.160 --> 40:04.320
Don't worry, Wanqing.

40:04.760 --> 40:05.840
If Shen Zaiye resorted to this tactic,

40:06.160 --> 40:07.600
it means the real painting
isn't in his possession.

40:08.440 --> 40:10.120
Please tell Her Majesty

40:10.640 --> 40:11.680
to be a little patient.

40:12.240 --> 40:13.320
I'll work with Shen Zaiye

40:13.400 --> 40:14.600
to find the real painting.

40:22.360 --> 40:24.200
Her Majesty always said
you were clever.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.640
Seems she was right.

40:28.640 --> 40:29.640
But Your Highness,

40:30.800 --> 40:31.880
perhaps you should

40:31.960 --> 40:33.280
rely less on petty tricks.

40:33.920 --> 40:36.600
This antidote will only keep the
poison at bay for a month after all.

40:37.240 --> 40:39.440
You won't bluff
your way through next time.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.760
Don't worry, Wanqing.

40:41.440 --> 40:42.600
I know what I'm doing.

40:46.040 --> 40:47.520
Madam surely is composed.

40:49.640 --> 40:50.680
This would've been
the perfect opportunity,

40:50.760 --> 40:51.760
yet she hasn't made a move.

40:51.960 --> 40:53.160
She just spends her days
sipping tea, admiring flowers,

40:53.240 --> 40:54.120
practicing calligraphy,
and playing the zither.

40:54.600 --> 40:55.160
We can't make a move

40:55.240 --> 40:56.360
until she makes hers.

40:57.120 --> 40:57.920
Now we're stuck in a stalemate.

40:58.560 --> 40:59.600
Please announce my arrival.

41:00.240 --> 41:02.040
I've come to personally thank Chancellor

41:02.400 --> 41:03.200
for his thoughtfulness.

41:03.560 --> 41:04.200
Let her in.

41:12.320 --> 41:12.920
Thank you.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.000
The shopkeeper said

41:34.320 --> 41:36.960
this is the most popular style right now

41:37.040 --> 41:39.160
among noble ladies in Yujing.

41:39.720 --> 41:40.680
Take a look.

41:41.000 --> 41:41.600
Do I look good?

41:44.640 --> 41:45.960
This fabric costs
ten taels of gold per foot.

41:46.680 --> 41:49.080
You certainly didn't hold back.

41:51.080 --> 41:52.360
You might actually think it's a bargain

41:52.920 --> 41:55.120
once you hear what I have to say.

41:58.280 --> 42:00.320
You're different today.

42:02.200 --> 42:03.600
Almost as if you've gained some

42:04.360 --> 42:05.040
confidence.

42:07.640 --> 42:10.280
I just happened to learn
a little secret of yours.

42:12.520 --> 42:13.880
Knowing my secrets

42:14.680 --> 42:16.200
is rarely a good thing.

42:18.680 --> 42:20.600
I've been reflecting these past days.

42:21.440 --> 42:22.720
What could I have possibly done

42:23.120 --> 42:24.600
to make you want me dead?

42:25.920 --> 42:27.320
After thinking it through,

42:29.240 --> 42:30.520
I suppose it must've been the day

42:31.000 --> 42:32.040
I accidentally entered your study

42:33.800 --> 42:35.840
and disrupted your trap
to lure someone out.

42:37.520 --> 42:39.920
The bait was those paintings.

42:41.280 --> 42:42.680
Plus the lockdown on the estate,

42:43.560 --> 42:46.840
someone must've taken
the painting you were after.

42:50.760 --> 42:51.400
Go on.

42:52.040 --> 42:53.880
You could've traced the mastermind

42:54.560 --> 42:56.520
through the servant I identified.

42:57.240 --> 42:58.440
But strangely,

42:58.920 --> 43:01.680
after his death, nothing happened.

43:03.200 --> 43:07.120
That tells me the person behind it
is someone you can't touch

43:07.640 --> 43:10.240
or won't touch.

43:11.160 --> 43:11.960
Jiang Taohua,

43:12.960 --> 43:14.360
you were raised in the palace.

43:15.040 --> 43:18.280
Surely you know this,
the more curious you are,

43:18.840 --> 43:20.280
the faster you die.

43:23.040 --> 43:24.320
Of course I know.

43:25.120 --> 43:27.600
But I'm just a helpless woman
in a foreign land.

43:28.480 --> 43:29.720
If I want to survive,

43:30.480 --> 43:31.760
my only choice is to work with you.

43:34.760 --> 43:35.800
If I can help you

43:36.240 --> 43:37.760
recover that painting,

43:38.440 --> 43:40.400
will you grant me your protection?

43:45.080 --> 43:46.320
You want to work with me?

43:47.440 --> 43:49.000
Wouldn't it be good to have some help?

43:52.320 --> 43:54.440
Only sheep and cattle travel in herds.

43:55.880 --> 43:56.760
But I…

43:57.480 --> 43:58.840
I walk alone.

44:03.680 --> 44:04.480
Jiang Taohua,

44:05.720 --> 44:07.240
I acknowledge your cleverness.

44:08.280 --> 44:10.280
You're even brave and resourceful.

44:14.600 --> 44:15.640
But so what?

44:17.040 --> 44:18.440
As a princess of royal blood,

44:19.320 --> 44:21.120
you're reduced to wounds and scars,

44:21.920 --> 44:23.640
begging for a chance to live

44:24.400 --> 44:26.560
as nothing more than a concubine.

44:30.640 --> 44:31.880
Judging by the current situation,

44:32.800 --> 44:33.920
you and Madam

44:34.560 --> 44:35.520
have reached an impasse.

44:36.480 --> 44:37.560
You're not getting that painting

44:38.000 --> 44:39.000
until she surrenders it.

44:39.720 --> 44:42.040
But I have a way to break that deadlock.

44:44.120 --> 44:46.360
I pledge myself to your service.

44:48.600 --> 44:50.040
The question is, will you give me

44:50.720 --> 44:52.320
the chance to walk beside you?

45:19.960 --> 45:23.160
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

45:23.240 --> 45:26.280
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

45:27.200 --> 45:30.320
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

45:30.440 --> 45:34.200
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

45:34.480 --> 45:37.560
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

45:37.680 --> 45:41.000
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

45:41.400 --> 45:44.960
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

45:45.040 --> 45:50.760
♪With no one it can be brought♪

45:55.720 --> 46:02.640
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

46:03.080 --> 46:09.920
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

46:10.400 --> 46:17.400
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

46:17.720 --> 46:21.760
♪Even if it means this flower♪

46:21.880 --> 46:28.840
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

46:39.960 --> 46:43.080
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

46:43.160 --> 46:46.400
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

46:46.760 --> 46:50.440
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

46:50.560 --> 46:57.120
♪No longer needing to say♪

47:01.200 --> 47:08.120
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

47:08.520 --> 47:15.480
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

47:15.840 --> 47:22.840
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

47:23.200 --> 47:24.880
♪And finding♪

47:24.960 --> 47:31.960
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
